{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09060","headline":"元日寄诸弟兼呈崔都水 · 韦应物","name":"元日寄诸弟兼呈崔都水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从守兹郡，两鬓生素发。\n新正加我年，故岁去超忽。\n淮滨益时候，了似仲秋月。\n川谷风景温，城池草木发。\n高斋属多暇，惆怅临芳物。\n日月昧还期，念君何时歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}